<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates rise to 7.21 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates rise to 7.21 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 7.21 percent on Saturday from 5.74 percent on Thursday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said five banks traded on the market in eleven reported transactions with a total value of 17.25 million dinars ($24 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.708 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
